            "text": "A flaw was found in React Router. This vulnerability, a type of Cross-Site Scripting (XSS), affects applications utilizing React Router's unstable React Server Components (RSC) APIs. A remote attacker could exploit this by sending untrusted redirects, leading to the execution of malicious scripts in the client's browser. This could result in information disclosure or unauthorized actions.",
