          {
            "category": "description",
            "text": "A flaw was found in Tornado. A remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability by injecting specially crafted characters into the `domain`, `path`, and `samesite` arguments when setting cookies. This could lead to cookie attribute injection, potentially allowing for information disclosure or manipulation of client-side data.",
